OL,3,AHealey acknowledges high government
OL,4,Aborrowing costs but won't be drawn on
OL,5,Atax changes in Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Healey acknowledges that
OL,8,Fgovernment borrowing costs are at
OL,9,F"historic highs", blaming "high
OL,10,Fborrowing and low growth"
OL,12,FIn his first major speech as
OL,13,Fchancellor, he says Britain's growth
OL,14,Ftrajectory has been weak and changing
OL,15,Fthis is "central" to his "purpose" in
OL,16,Fthe role
OL,18,FExplaining how he plans to do this,
OL,19,FHealey says: "More devolution, more
OL,20,Fpublic leadership and control, more
OL,21,Finvestment, more innovation, more jobs"
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
